<section class="page-head">
  <div class="wrap">
    <div class="eyebrow label">Be part of it</div>
    <h1>Get <em>involved</em></h1>
    <p>PACA runs on the people who show up. Here are the ways to be one of them.</p>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="block">
  <div class="wrap">
    <div class="involve">
      <div class="inv rv"><div class="ic" style="color:var(--magenta)">♥</div><h4>Donate</h4><p>Every gift keeps the lights on and the stage open. Through our donation platform, 100% of your gift reaches PACA.</p><a href="{{ site.donate }}" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Support PACA →</a></div>
      <div class="inv rv"><div class="ic" style="color:var(--lime)">✶</div><h4>Volunteer</h4><p>Ushers, crew, box office, load-in and front-of-house. No experience needed, just enthusiasm.</p><a href="mailto:paca1505@gmail.com">Email us →</a></div>
      <div class="inv rv"><div class="ic" style="color:var(--yellow)">◆</div><h4>Audition</h4><p>Casting calls and audition details for upcoming PACA productions.</p><a href="/auditions/">Audition info →</a></div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="block">
  <div class="wrap">
    <div class="sec-head rv"><h2>Get in touch</h2></div>
    <p class="rv" style="color:var(--fog);max-width:60ch;margin:-24px 0 30px">Questions, ideas, or just want to say hello? Send us a note and we'll get back to you.</p>
    <form name="contact" method="POST" data-netlify="true" netlify-honeypot="bot-field" class="rform rv">
      <input type="hidden" name="form-name" value="contact">
      <p hidden><label>Leave this empty: <input name="bot-field"></label></p>
      <div><label>Name *</label><input type="text" name="name" required></div>
      <div><label>Email *</label><input type="email" name="email" required></div>
      <div class="full"><label>Subject</label><input type="text" name="subject"></div>
      <div class="full"><label>Message *</label><textarea name="message" required></textarea></div>
      <div class="full"><button class="btn btn-primary" type="submit">Send message</button></div>
    </form>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="news">
  <div class="wrap rv">
    <h2>Never miss <em>a show</em></h2>
    <p>Get show announcements and the occasional behind-the-curtain note. No spam, ever.</p>
    <form name="newsletter" method="POST" data-netlify="true" class="form">
      <input type="hidden" name="form-name" value="newsletter">
      <input type="email" name="email" placeholder="you@example.com" aria-label="Email address" required>
      <button class="btn btn-primary" type="submit">Subscribe</button>
    </form>
  </div>
</section>
